    "created_at": "2017-04-13T22:54:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-13T22:54:34Z",
    "body": "I don't think the second value is necessary. If you want to handle the loading yourself, I would think you could just remove the lazy-loading attribute from the images, which would stop/prevent the browser from doing it.",
