    "created_at": "2017-04-13T22:58:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-13T22:59:17Z",
    "body": "With the second value, the premature loading of images would still be prevented by default. Otherwise websites would have to insert the `img` element using a script, meaning user agents without scripting won't have an image to show.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
